# Cloudflare routing for db.ripostelabs.xyz  (assets-only Worker; see wrangler.jsonc)
# (Ignored by GitHub Pages; only affects the Cloudflare deploy.)
#
# No rules are needed:
#   /        -> index.html   (the public magazine; served automatically)
#   /studio  -> studio.html  (served automatically by html_handling = auto-trailing-slash)
#
# Do NOT add a `/studio  /studio.html  200` rewrite: html_handling redirects the
# .html asset back to the clean /studio URL, so a rewrite creates an infinite
# 307 redirect loop. Let the clean-URL handling serve studio.html at /studio.
